<title>ESTONIA: HANSAPANK CUM-DIV TRADING TO END.</title>
<headline>HANSAPANK CUM-DIV TRADING TO END.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1997-04-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trading in Hansapank's shares will be ex-dividend after today, the Tallinn stock exchange said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Trade in the stock from April 23 will be ex-dividend, it added in a statement.</p>
<p>The list of shareholders allowed to take part in the in the bank's bonus share issue and dividend payment will be fixed on April 28, the exchange added.</p>
<p>Hansapank will pay a dividend of 1.25 kroons a share and the share issue will one new share for each share held.</p>
<p>-- Tallinn newsroom +372 630 8400 reuters@reuters.ee</p>
</text>
